:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Uber Rare Cat)|Ranma Saotome (M)]].''

'''Ranma Saotome (M)''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ranma Saotome (M)
|image = E 542.png
|money drop = 1,900¢ - 7,900¢
|appearance = [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy sports high health, high attack power, multi-hit, [[Omni Strike|Omni-Strike]] and fast movement speed. He also has low to average attack range.

Despite wearing a red shirt, he is not considered a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy.

==Strategy==
Use powerful, long-ranged cats to kill him fast as he is easy to outrange due to his fairly low attack range.

